100
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,100
@PrehistoricJungleScene {Transition:Fade|duration=0.5}
{Camera:Static|position=0,2.5,8|lookAt=0,1.2,0}

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,500
[DaHou]{Music:Play|name=jungle_tension|endTime=130|baseVolume=0.4}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 今天练习团队配合。豹豹负责速度，橙爪负责正面，我负责最后一击。

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,500
[BaoBao]{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 终于不只是让我跑步了！

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,500
[ChengZhua]{Animation:CrossArms|character=ChengZhua}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 比单打独斗更像真正的战队。

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,500
[DaHou]{Animation:PointForward|character=DaHou}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 配合不是排队，是同时发力。再来一次！

101
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,100
@VolcanoBaseScene {Transition:Fade|duration=0.5}
{Position:LongZong|x=0|y=0|z=0|face=forward}
{Camera:Static|position=0,2.5,8|lookAt=0,1.2,0}

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,000
[LongZong]{Animation:FaceDetermined|character=LongZong}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 小嗡，诱饵准备好了吗？我要让毛茸茸联盟见识真正的烧烤。

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,500
[XiaoWeng]{Animation:LookAround|character=XiaoWeng}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 老大，我演技很差，会穿帮的……

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,500
[LongZong]{Animation:PointForward|character=LongZong}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 不用演！直接飞过去喊救命，他们那种傻子肯定会来。

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,500
[LongZong]{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 等他们进了火山，我就启动火花糖牢笼，把他们全烤熟！

102
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:40,100
@PrehistoricJungleScene {Transition:Fade|duration=0.5}
{Position:DaHou|x=-1.5|y=0|z=0|face=DaHou}
{Position:BaoBao|x=0|y=0|z=0.5|face=DaHou}
{Position:ChengZhua|x=1.5|y=0|z=0|face=DaHou}
{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0}

9
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:45,000
[XiaoWeng]{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 救命啊！龙总掉进火山了！要被烤熟了！

10
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,500
[BaoBao]{Animation:LookAround|character=BaoBao}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 真的假的？烧烤集团改行自杀了？

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
[DaHou]{Animation:CrossArms|character=DaHou}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 可能是陷阱，但不能见死不救。豹豹侦察，橙爪掩护，我垫后。

103
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:55,600
@VolcanoBaseScene {Transition:Fade|duration=0.5}
{Position:LongZong|x=0|y=0|z=0|face=forward}
{Position:XiaoWeng|x=2.0|y=0.8|z=0.5|face=LongZong}
{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0}

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,500
[LongZong]{Animation:PointForward|character=LongZong}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 哈哈哈！欢迎来到烧烤集团的陷阱餐厅！

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,500
[DaHou]{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 果然有诈。但你是不是忘了，我们有三个人？

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,500
[LongZong]{Animation:CrossArms|character=LongZong}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 三个人又怎样？火花糖牢笼，启动！

15
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,500
[XiaoWeng]{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 老大，牢笼的能量好强！我自己也快被烤到了！

16
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,500
[DaHou]{Animation:PointForward|character=DaHou}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 战队阵型！豹豹破坏能量线，橙爪正面牵制，我攻击控制核心！

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,500
[BaoBao]{Animation:LookAround|character=BaoBao}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 猎豹全速，绕起来！

18
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,500
[ChengZhua]{Animation:PointForward|character=ChengZhua}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 能量剑，启动！正面交给我！

19
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,500
[LongZong]{Animation:HitStagger|character=LongZong}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 可恶！你们居然会 teamwork！

20
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,500
[DaHou]{Animation:LeftPunch|character=DaHou}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 猩猩重拳！这就是毛茸茸联盟的进化！

21
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,500
[LongZong]{Animation:HitStagger|character=LongZong}{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 不——我的火花糖牢笼！能量失控了！

22
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,500
[XiaoWeng]{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 老大，快跑！火山要喷发了！

23
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,500
[LongZong]{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,1.5,0} 这次算你们赢！下次我会带更大的牢笼！

104
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,100
@VolcanoBaseScene {Transition:Fade|duration=0.5}
{Position:DaHou|x=-1.5|y=0|z=0|face=forward}
{Position:BaoBao|x=0|y=0|z=0|face=DaHou}
{Position:ChengZhua|x=1.5|y=0|z=0|face=DaHou}
{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0}

24
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:58,000
[BaoBao]{Animation:FaceHappy|character=BaoBao}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 我们赢了！团队配合果然厉害！

25
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:03,000
[ChengZhua]{Animation:CrossArms|character=ChengZhua}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 不过，火山壁上那扇金属门是什么？战斗前还没有。

26
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:09,000
[DaHou]{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,7|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 看起来不是自然形成的。看来这颗星球除了火花糖，还藏着别的东西。下集继续。

105
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:11,000
@VolcanoBaseScene {Transition:Fade|duration=1.0}
{Camera:Static|position=0,3,10|lookAt=0,0,0}
